    <h2>Cookie Dough Blizzard Cake — The Second Most Popular DQ Blizzard Cake</h2>
  <p>After the <a href="/items/oreo-blizzard-cake">Oreo® Blizzard® Cake</a>, the Cookie Dough Blizzard Cake is the second most ordered Blizzard Cake at DQ. It uses the same Cookie Dough Blizzard mix-in — actual chocolate chip cookie dough pieces — distributed throughout the soft serve layers of a full celebration cake. The result is the chunky, chewy texture of the Cookie Dough Blizzard in a shareable format. Find the full cake lineup on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

